      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I understand your frustration, but a highly confrontational statement might not be the most effective approach. Consider drafting a statement that acknowledges your early contributions and express your feelings without making accusations. For example, you could say:\n\n\"I've been inspired to see how the synthwave and lo-fi scenes have evolved, but a crucial part of this sonic identity is still missing – the essence of my early bedroom recordings, created with passion and creativity in 2012. I'm proud to have been at the forefront of this sound, but unfortunately, my contributions were often overlooked and undervalued. I'd like to share my story and invite others to rediscover the roots of this movement, ensuring that those who paved the way receive the recognition they deserve.\"",
